    {
        "Id": 144,
        "ActionId": 140,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lilith",
            "I don't get it. Babylonia's Purifying Force is getting close to the truth, and we let the Forsaken discover the list of names \"just in time.\""
